    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d368">

                <pb facs="0477" n="381" sameAs="frus:frus1899/pg381"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Powell to Mr. Hay.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Port au Prince</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1899-08-05"><hi rendition="#italic">August 5,
                        1899</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Cable has been received. Will follow instructions. Situation very bad; arrests
                    still being made. The legation full of refugees. May need naval vessel to
                    protect our interests. If so, will cable.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Powell.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
